K_low(m) 取自 dt2_frontier.py（初等起点 + 自举 + 停点）；K_up_Rhin = 1.4784*m*δ^m

   m | K_surv(m)          | K_low(m)           | K_low/K_surv | Rhin 上界 1.4784mδ^m | 差值倍数
  88 | 4.86233e+19        | 1.3929e+27         | 2.865e+7     | 4.92113e+19          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9881
  89 | 7.87863e+19        | 2.0563e+20         | 2.61         | 7.88844e+19          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9988
  90 | 1.24901e+20        | 1.1322e+28         | 9.065e+7     | 1.26434e+20          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9879
  91 | 2.12308e+20        | 7.94196e+21        | 37.41        | 2.14073e+20          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9918
  92 | 3.36568e+20        | 7.76921e+19        | 0.2308       | 3.43026e+20          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9812
  93 | 5.33554e+20        | 7.76921e+19        | 0.1456       | 5.49593e+20          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9708
  94 | 8.4583e+20         | 7.76921e+19        | 0.09185      | 8.80451e+20          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9607
  95 | 1.34087e+21        | -                  | -            | 1.41033e+21          | K_surv/Rhin = 0.9508

